              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawa angamadodana kaLeya awazalela uJakobe ePhadani Aramu kanye nendodakazi yakhe uDina; yonke imiphefumulo yamadodana akhe namadodakazi akhe yayingamashumi amathathu nantathu.",
          "type": "text",
