              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawa angamadodana kaBiliha uLabani amnika uRaheli indodakazi yakhe; wamzalela wona uJakobe; yonke imiphefumulo yayiyisikhombisa.",
