          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJosefa walungisa inqola yakhe, wakhuphuka ukumhlangabeza u-Israyeli uyise eGosheni, wammisa phambi kwakhe; wawela entanyeni yakhe wakhala isikhathi eside entanyeni yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
