              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nithi: ‘Umsebenzi wezinceku zakho kwasebusheni bethu kuze kube manje wawunezinkomo, thina nawobaba, ukuze nihlale ezweni laseGosheni; ngoba bonke abelusi bayisinengiso kwabaseGibhithe.",
